---
description: Global Flutter AI engineering rules
alwaysApply: true
---

For Flutter/Dart projects, follow the global `flutter-ai-agent` skill.

Before coding:
- inspect pubspec.yaml
- inspect lib/ and test/
- detect architecture/state/networking/routing/persistence
- read project-local instructions

Adapt to the existing architecture.

Do not force Riverpod, BLoC, Clean Architecture, or another framework if the project uses something else.

After meaningful changes:
- dart format .
- flutter analyze
- run relevant tests
